{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05147","headline":"奉和张燕公早霁南楼 · 赵冬曦","name":"奉和张燕公早霁南楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方曙跻南楼，凭轩肆遐瞩。\n物华荡暄气，春景媚晴旭。\n川霁湘山孤，林芳楚郊缛。\n列岩重叠翠，远岸逶迤绿。\n风帆摩天垠，鱼艇散弯曲。\n鸿归鹤舞送，猨叫莺声续。\n羣动皆熙熙，噫予独羁束。\n常钦才子意，忌鵩伤蜷局。\n雅尚骚人文，怀沙何迫促。\n未知二贤意，去矣从所欲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵冬曦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}